WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.537 --> 00:00:03.132
(old fashioned music)

00:00:11.912 --> 00:00:13.230
(ice clattering)

00:00:14.094 --> 00:00:14.866
- Do I try it?

00:00:14.866 --> 00:00:15.812
(laughing)

00:00:15.812 --> 00:00:18.041
Tastes kinda like a mint syrup.

00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:19.254
In like a really good way.

00:00:19.254 --> 00:00:21.520
(remixed old fashioned music)

00:00:30.645 --> 00:00:33.501
Really soft, cloudy, and creamy.

00:00:33.501 --> 00:00:36.410
This is like the latte
of alcoholic beverages.

00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:47.485
I don't know if I would call this a sipper

00:00:47.485 --> 00:00:49.343
'cuz it's just so easy to drink.

00:00:49.343 --> 00:00:50.225
- A chugger.

00:00:50.975 --> 00:00:51.697
(laughing)

00:00:51.697 --> 00:00:52.277
- Yeah.

00:00:52.277 --> 00:00:53.591
You know, I think this
is my favorite so far.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.102
It's really smooth again.

00:01:06.102 --> 00:01:08.448
Like all these old drinks
are just so smooth.

00:01:08.448 --> 00:01:10.375
Honestly, it comes together like

00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:12.598
a bite of raw pineapple.

00:01:25.235 --> 00:01:26.641
The best color so far.

00:01:27.599 --> 00:01:28.987
It's like grapefruit juice.

00:01:28.987 --> 00:01:30.218
Oh, that's good.

00:01:30.218 --> 00:01:30.631
- Right?

00:01:30.631 --> 00:01:31.647
- Yeah.

